{{ 'section-custom-request.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- comment -%}
  "Не виждате своето? Ще го направим." -- a way to ask for a piece that is not in
  the shop (2026-10-04, after the owner's go on the honest-opinion round). About
  fifty pieces are online and the atelier has made far more since 1991, so the
  thing a catalogue-only brand cannot offer is "tell us what you are looking for".

  No twin on moonmagic's homepage: their nearest block, "Made for you", is an
  image-with-text section. This is the first section here with no reference to
  copy, so it takes only the site's own parts -- the eyebrow, the heading size of
  every other homepage band, Dawn's field styles and the contact-methods button.

  It is Shopify's own contact form, so a message arrives at the store's email
  exactly as the Контакти form's does, and there is no new backend. Shopify's
  contact form cannot carry an attachment, which is why a picture goes by email,
  Instagram or Facebook (the three links under the words, each shown only when it
  is set). The name, phone and message use Shopify's own keys, so a refused form
  keeps what was typed; two hidden fields tell the owner which form it came from
  and, on a product page, which piece.

  Every claim in the default words is one the site already makes: the atelier has
  worked since 1991, and a piece shown here "can be made with" another stone is
  the old site's own sentence on nearly every product. No number of designs is
  printed -- it is a setting for the owner to add once it is a figure to stand
  behind. The privacy link only prints when the shop has a privacy policy page,
  so it can never point nowhere, and says nothing about the data.

  On a product page (2026-10-04, "product-specific enquiries") it becomes a
  question about that piece: the band carries the anchor #zapitvane, which the
  buy box's "Попитайте за това бижу" link jumps to; the subject line reads
  „Въпрос за бижу“; and three hidden lines tell the owner which piece -- its
  title, its address with the chosen variant, and the variant itself (size,
  metal). The variant lines follow the shopper's choice through Dawn's
  variant-change event, so the message names what was selected when it was sent.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- style -%}
  .section-{{ section.id }}-padding {
    padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
  }

  .section-{{ section.id }}-margin {
    margin-top: {{ section.settings.margin_top | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ section.settings.margin_bottom | times: 0.75 | round: 0 }}px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .section-{{ section.id }}-padding {
      padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    }

    .section-{{ section.id }}-margin {
      margin-top: {{ section.settings.margin_top }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ section.settings.margin_bottom }}px;
    }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

{%- liquid
  assign form_id = 'CustomRequest-' | append: section.id
  assign email = section.settings.email | strip
  assign layout = section.settings.layout | default: 'open'
  assign has_ways = false
  if section.settings.show_ways
    if email != blank or settings.social_instagram_link != blank or settings.social_facebook_link != blank
      assign has_ways = true
    endif
  endif
-%}

<div
  class="color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }} gradient section-{{ section.id }}-margin"
  {% if product %}
    id="zapitvane"
  {% endif %}
>
  <div class="custom-request{% if layout != 'open' %} custom-request--{{ layout }}{% endif %} page-width section-{{ section.id }}-padding">
    <div class="custom-request__intro">
      {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="custom-request__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
        <h2 class="custom-request__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.text != blank -%}
        <p class="custom-request__text">{{ section.settings.text | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- capture ways_markup -%}
      {%- if has_ways -%}
        <div class="custom-request__ways">
          <p class="custom-request__ways-label">Имате снимка? Изпратете ни я:</p>
          <ul class="custom-request__ways-list" role="list">
            {%- if email != blank -%}
              <li>
                <a href="mailto:{{ email | escape }}?subject={{ 'Изработка по поръчка' | url_encode }}">по имейл</a>
              </li>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if settings.social_instagram_link != blank -%}
              <li>
                <a href="{{ settings.social_instagram_link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">в Instagram<span class="visually-hidden"> (отваря се в нов прозорец)</span></a>
              </li>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if settings.social_facebook_link != blank -%}
              <li>
                <a href="{{ settings.social_facebook_link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">във Facebook<span class="visually-hidden"> (отваря се в нов прозорец)</span></a>
              </li>
            {%- endif -%}
          </ul>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- endcapture -%}
      {%- unless layout == 'collapsible' -%}{{ ways_markup }}{%- endunless -%}

      {%- if layout == 'collapsible' -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Homepage (2026-10-05, owner): the title and a short introduction stay; the form and
          the reference-photo links open under „Изпратете запитване“. Collapsed at first;
          opens again after sending, so the thank-you or the error shows.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <button
          type="button"
          class="custom-request__toggle"
          aria-expanded="false"
          aria-controls="{{ form_id }}-panel"
          data-request-toggle
        >
          {{- section.settings.toggle_label | default: 'Изпратете запитване' | escape -}}
          <span class="custom-request__chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if layout == 'popup' -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Product page (2026-10-05, owner): a compact band with one button; the form opens in
          a popup styled like the size guide. „Попитайте за това бижу“ near the buy button
          (href #zapitvane) opens the same popup.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <button
          type="button"
          class="custom-request__open"
          data-enquiry-open
          aria-haspopup="dialog"
          aria-controls="{{ form_id }}-dialog"
        >
          {{- section.settings.popup_button_label | default: 'Попитайте за това бижу' | escape -}}
        </button>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- capture request_form -%}
    {%- form 'contact', id: form_id, class: 'custom-request__form' -%}
      {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
        <span data-enquiry-reopen hidden></span>
        <p class="custom-request__status" role="status" tabindex="-1" autofocus>
          {{- section.settings.success_message | escape -}}
        </p>
      {%- else -%}
        {%- if form.errors -%}
          <span data-enquiry-reopen hidden></span>
          <p class="custom-request__status custom-request__status--error" role="alert" tabindex="-1" autofocus>
            {{- section.settings.error_message | escape -}}
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%}
          Which form this came from, and on a product page which piece. They
          arrive in the store's email as lines of their own.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if product -%}
          {%- assign enquiry_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[Тема]" value="Въпрос за бижу">
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[Бижу]" value="{{ product.title | escape }}">
          <input
            type="hidden"
            name="contact[Връзка]"
            value="{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}?variant={{ enquiry_variant.id }}"
            data-enquiry-url="{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}"
          >
          {%- unless product.has_only_default_variant -%}
            <input type="hidden" name="contact[Вариант]" value="{{ enquiry_variant.title | escape }}" data-enquiry-variant>
          {%- endunless -%}
        {%- else -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[Тема]" value="Изработка по поръчка">
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="custom-request__row">
          <div class="field">
            <input
              class="field__input"
              type="text"
              id="{{ form_id }}-name"
              name="contact[name]"
              autocomplete="name"
              value="{{ form.name }}"
              placeholder="Име"
            >
            <label class="field__label" for="{{ form_id }}-name">Име</label>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <input
              class="field__input"
              type="email"
              id="{{ form_id }}-email"
              name="contact[email]"
              autocomplete="email"
              spellcheck="false"
              autocapitalize="off"
              required
              aria-required="true"
              value="{{ form.email }}"
              placeholder="Имейл"
              {% if form.errors contains 'email' %}
                aria-invalid="true"
              {% endif %}
            >
            <label class="field__label" for="{{ form_id }}-email">Имейл <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          </div>
        </div>

        {%- comment -%}
          No pattern: Dawn's [0-9\-]* refuses +359 and spaces, the way most
          Bulgarian customers write a number.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="field">
          <input
            class="field__input"
            type="tel"
            id="{{ form_id }}-phone"
            name="contact[phone]"
            autocomplete="tel"
            value="{{ form.phone }}"
            placeholder="Телефон (по желание)"
          >
          <label class="field__label" for="{{ form_id }}-phone">Телефон (по желание)</label>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <textarea
            class="text-area field__input"
            id="{{ form_id }}-body"
            name="contact[body]"
            rows="5"
            required
            aria-required="true"
            placeholder="{% if product %}Вашият въпрос{% else %}Какво търсите?{% endif %}"
          >{{ form.body }}</textarea>
          <label class="field__label" for="{{ form_id }}-body">
            {%- if product %}Вашият въпрос{% else %}Какво търсите?{% endif %} <span aria-hidden="true">*</span>
          </label>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="custom-request__button">
          {{- section.settings.button_label | escape -}}
        </button>

        {%- if shop.privacy_policy != blank -%}
          <p class="custom-request__privacy">
            <a href="{{ shop.privacy_policy.url }}">Политика за поверителност</a>
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endform -%}
    {%- endcapture -%}

    {%- if layout == 'popup' -%}
      <dialog
        id="{{ form_id }}-dialog"
        class="size-guide custom-request__dialog color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}"
        aria-labelledby="{{ form_id }}-dialog-title"
      >
        <div class="size-guide__inner">
          <form method="dialog" class="size-guide__close-form">
            <button type="submit" class="size-guide__close">
              Затвори<span class="size-guide__cross" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </button>
          </form>
          <h2 id="{{ form_id }}-dialog-title" class="size-guide__title h3">
            {{- section.settings.heading | default: 'Имате въпрос за това бижу?' | escape -}}
          </h2>
          {{ request_form }}
        </div>
      </dialog>
      <script>
        (function () {
          var dialog = document.getElementById({{ form_id | append: '-dialog' | json }});
          if (!dialog || typeof dialog.showModal !== 'function') return;
          var opener = null;
          function open(trigger) {
            opener = trigger || document.activeElement;
            if (!dialog.open) dialog.showModal();
          }
          // The section's button and every link to #zapitvane (the one near the buy button).
          document.addEventListener('click', function (event) {
            var trigger = event.target.closest('[data-enquiry-open], a[href="#zapitvane"]');
            if (!trigger) return;
            event.preventDefault();
            open(trigger);
          });
          // A click on the backdrop lands on the dialog itself.
          dialog.addEventListener('click', function (event) {
            if (event.target === dialog) dialog.close();
          });
          // Escape and „Затвори“ close it natively; focus goes back to what opened it.
          dialog.addEventListener('close', function () {
            if (opener && document.contains(opener)) opener.focus();
          });
          // After sending (thank-you or an error), the page reloads: show the message in the popup.
          if (dialog.querySelector('[data-enquiry-reopen]')) {
            open(document.querySelector('[data-enquiry-open]'));
          }
        })();
      </script>
    {%- elsif layout == 'collapsible' -%}
      <div id="{{ form_id }}-panel" class="custom-request__panel" hidden>
        {{ request_form }}
        {{ ways_markup }}
      </div>
      <script>
        (function () {
          var panel = document.getElementById({{ form_id | append: '-panel' | json }});
          if (!panel) return;
          var toggle = panel.parentElement.querySelector('[data-request-toggle]');
          function setOpen(open) {
            panel.hidden = !open;
            toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));
          }
          toggle.addEventListener('click', function () {
            setOpen(panel.hidden);
          });
          if (panel.querySelector('[data-enquiry-reopen]')) setOpen(true);
        })();
      </script>
    {%- else -%}
      {{ request_form }}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

{%- if product -%}
  <script>
    // pubsub.js is deferred, so wait for it (deferred scripts run before DOMContentLoaded).
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
      var form = document.getElementById({{ form_id | json }});
      if (!form || typeof subscribe !== 'function' || typeof PUB_SUB_EVENTS === 'undefined') return;
      subscribe(PUB_SUB_EVENTS.variantChange, function (event) {
        var variant = event && event.data && event.data.variant;
        if (!variant) return;
        var url = form.querySelector('[data-enquiry-url]');
        var title = form.querySelector('[data-enquiry-variant]');
        if (url) url.value = url.dataset.enquiryUrl + '?variant=' + variant.id;
        if (title) title.value = variant.title;
      });
    });
  </script>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Custom request",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "disabled_on": {
    "groups": ["header", "footer"]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "layout",
      "label": "Form layout",
      "options": [
        { "value": "open", "label": "Form always open" },
        { "value": "popup", "label": "Button that opens the form in a popup" },
        { "value": "collapsible", "label": "Button that expands the form" }
      ],
      "default": "open"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "toggle_label",
      "label": "Expand button text",
      "default": "Изпратете запитване"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "popup_button_label",
      "label": "Popup button text",
      "default": "Попитайте за това бижу"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Colour scheme",
      "default": "scheme-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Small line above the heading",
      "default": "Изработка по поръчка"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Не виждате своето? Ще го направим."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "info": "No number of designs is printed by default. Add one here only when it is a figure the shop can stand behind.",
      "default": "Тук показваме само малка част от моделите на ателието. Кажете ни какво търсите — друг камък, друг метал, друг размер или бижу, което сте виждали — и ще ви отговорим."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Form"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "button_label",
      "label": "Button",
      "default": "Изпратете запитване"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "success_message",
      "label": "Message after sending",
      "default": "Благодарим ви. Ще ви отговорим възможно най-скоро."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "error_message",
      "label": "Message when the email is missing or wrong",
      "default": "Моля, въведете валиден имейл адрес."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Send a picture"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_ways",
      "label": "Show the line about sending a picture",
      "info": "Shopify's contact form cannot carry an attachment, so a picture goes by email, Instagram or Facebook.",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "email",
      "label": "Email for pictures",
      "info": "Leave empty to hide the email link. Instagram and Facebook come from Theme settings > Social media.",
      "default": "cullinanjewellery.bg@gmail.com"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding top",
      "default": 64
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding bottom",
      "default": 64
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Space around the band"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "margin_top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Space above",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "margin_bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Space below",
      "default": 0
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Custom request"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
